 "remarks": "A rare opportunity in one of Westport's most sought-after locations! The cul de sac off of a private road is not travelled by most, hidden from the Compo Beach walkers. Set on an ultra private double lot, 12 Murvon Court offers exceptional flexibility and possibilities for the future. The existing home provides a wonderful opportunity to enjoy the property as-is, or, renovate and expand with the potential to create a larger home tailored to today's lifestyle. For those considering a new build, the double-lot setting and elevated position create the potential to capture beautiful views toward Long Island Sound with thoughtful new construction.  Ideally located in the coveted Greens Farms Elementary School district and just steps from Compo Beach, this property puts Westport's beaches, schools, shopping, dining, and village amenities within easy reach. Whether expanding the existing home or starting fresh, 12 Murvon Court offers something increasingly hard to find in Westport: land, location, flexibility, and the opportunity to create something truly special.",
